        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 300000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.04\n    loan_term_years = 30\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -total_payments)\n    )\n    total_interest_paid = monthly_payment * total_payments - principal\n    answer = round(total_interest_paid)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
